    <informations>Shelly 1PM Gen3 — mounting plate, back view.
Terminals, left to right as printed: O SW L L L N N.
Back view: the terminal order is mirrored against the front label face.

Official sources:
https://kb.shelly.cloud/knowledge-base/shelly-1pm-gen3
https://kb.shelly.cloud/__attachments/a_ae928b2971f046cbb795b9c5c51dba4d7b1e2e75ad852267ad540f4110cd9160/Shelly%201PM%20Gen3.jpg?cb=7d86259155eb0a6a8a606736af8dedef
